      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel like it's sometimes important to point out that the VRChat developers do have access to the internet. Every time something is announced as a feature, there's always a very low effort feature request post about it.\n\nIf you actually want them to implement something you should consider linking to something, like a document about it, or a demonstration video.\n\nHow many people is it suitable for? Does this run on the headset? I have a few quest standalone friends, and from what I can gather, the quest 2 doesn't have a lot of extra CPU time to spend on anything new.",
